  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"91\">🏁 Nintendo Wii Game – Mario Kart Wii | €24,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"369\"><strong data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"134\">Mario Kart Wii</strong> is één van de populairste racespellen voor de Nintendo Wii. Race met bekende Mario-personages over spectaculaire banen en geniet van urenlang plezier, alleen of samen met vrienden en familie. De game is getest en <strong data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"368\">direct speelbaar</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"388\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<li data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"419\">\r\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"419\"><strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"404\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Wii</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"448\">\r\n<p data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"448\"><strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"431\">Game:</strong> Mario Kart Wii</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"468\">\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"468\"><strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"461\">Genre:</strong> Race</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"514\">\r\n<p data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"514\"><strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"485\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer & Multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"547\"><strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"530\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"562\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<li data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"609\">Klassieke en populaire Mario Kart gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"639\">Geschikt voor jong en oud</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"687\">\r\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"687\">Multiplayer plezier met vrienden en familie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"741\">Ondersteunt Wii-stuur voor realistische besturing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"769\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"780\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"792\"><strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"792\">€ 24,99</strong></p>",
